    "innovation": "This paper demonstrates that complex Greenland outlet glacier flow can be accurately reproduced by combining a high-resolution ice-sheet model with a new subglacial topography dataset and uniformly applied physics, removing the need for spatially varying parameters and local tuning for prognostic modeling.",
